- Yes, there's been a lot of bad shit,

00:13:43.720 --> 00:13:45.550
but I've also hurt you.

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:46.921
- Can't we just call it even?
- Please stop.

00:13:46.921 --> 00:13:48.350
- You can't just--

00:13:48.350 --> 00:13:50.073
- Please stop fighting this.

00:13:51.720 --> 00:13:53.193
You need to let me go too.

00:13:54.460 --> 00:13:56.020
- I love you.

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:57.123
I love you.

00:13:59.180 --> 00:14:00.613
- I will always love you.

00:14:01.837 --> 00:14:04.420
(gentle music)

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:12.103
- [Piper] But now, when I say clean,

00:14:13.570 --> 00:14:16.003
I'm not talking about
baths and showers anymore.

00:14:18.940 --> 00:14:20.903
I'm talking about a clean sweep,

00:14:28.750 --> 00:14:29.583
clean living,

00:14:41.778 --> 00:14:43.361
a clean conscience,

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:50.753
and a clean slate.

00:14:51.941 --> 00:14:54.524
(upbeat music)

